Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://lvgl.io/
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/ckeller42/xrdp-nvidia-ppa
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: liblvgl9
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Light and Versatile Graphics Library (xrdp login build)
 LVGL is a graphics library for embedded and desktop UIs with widgets,
 animations and anti-aliased software rendering.
 .
 This build is configured for the xrdp LVGL login screen: 32-bit colour,
 system heap, complex software renderer and FreeType fonts.

Package: liblvgl-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: liblvgl9 (= ${binary:Version}), libfreetype-dev, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Light and Versatile Graphics Library (xrdp login build) - development files
 LVGL is a graphics library for embedded and desktop UIs with widgets,
 animations and anti-aliased software rendering.
 .
 This package contains the headers, the lv_conf.h this library was built
 with and the pkg-config file.
